The browser-owned Iris data resource is derived from the UCI Iris dataset (CC BY 4.0) through the
corrected scikit-learn distribution (BSD-3-Clause). The mtcars, InsectSprays, and faithful CSV
resources are distributed as CC0. Exact provenance, immutable revisions, and resource hashes are
recorded in docs/core-data-provenance.md.

The browser-owned ability.cov resource is an independently authored transcription of the compact
covariance facts published in the Oxford-hosted Statistics Complements to Modern Applied Statistics
with S. Its source trail and clean-room compatibility projection are recorded in
docs/core-data-provenance.md.

The browser-owned HairEyeColor resource is an independently authored transcription of the compact
statistical facts published by Michael Friendly's Data Visualization site and attributed to Snee
(1974). Its audited source hash and clean-room compatibility projection are recorded in
docs/core-data-provenance.md.

The browser-owned UCBAdmissions resource is an independently authored transcription of the compact
1973 Berkeley admissions counts independently published by Random Services and attributed to
Bickel, Hammel, and O'Connell (1975). Its clean-room compatibility projection is recorded in
docs/core-data-provenance.md.

The browser-owned stackloss, stack.x, and stack.loss resources reproduce the public-domain
Brownlee stack-loss table from the pinned statsmodels 0.14.6 distribution. Exact provenance and
resource integrity are recorded in docs/core-data-provenance.md.

The browser-owned airquality resource reproduces the PDDL-1.0-licensed 153-observation table
published by csvbase.com. Exact provenance and resource integrity are recorded in
docs/core-data-provenance.md.

